  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a senior loan of up to USD 65 million in favour of JSC Rustavi  Azot (the &quot;Company&quot;), a joint stock company incorporated in Georgia, a leading  chemical manufacturer in Georgia.  The Loan proceeds will be applied to finance: (i) the construction of a new low  density ammonium nitrate (LDAN) plant located in Rustavi, Georgia, on territory  of the existing plant; (ii) capital expenditures for energy efficiency  improvements of the existing plant and (iii) working capital requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
